**Conversation Context:**
- You have access to the full conversation history in this session
- All previous messages, tool results, and file contents you've read are available to-Ops block (`::result ok`, etc.).

**State Persistence:**
- The "Current State" section below shows your current phase, active plans, and tasks
- This state persists across turns in
