# Sym-Ops v3.2 Specification

## 1. Core Symbols
`>>` = Thought, `::` = Action/Vitals, `@` = Target path, `>` = Dependency, `<<<`/`>>>` = Content block delimiters.

## 2. Vitals (output before every action)
`::c[0-1] ::s[0-1] ::m[0-1] ::f[0-1]` — Confidence, Safety, Memory, Focus.
